# W10b, host a (k5): hosts in stag0101 near its entrance; once b, playing in a's stage group, is defeated, a removes it
# (INSTANCE_OP remove) and plays on alone: its stage group neither ends nor follows b home.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts in stag0101
wander -150 -60 20 until present=2,sealed>=600 fail stagechange
log b joined a
wander -150 -60 20 until partnerdead fail stagechange
log b is defeated
remove {user:b}
log a removed b
wander -150 -60 20 until present=1 fail stagechange
log b is gone
wander -150 -60 20 until frames>=1800 fail stagechange
log a plays on
